  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 104.58 Temporary permit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 104.58 “Temporary permit” means a permit issued prior to October 29, 1997, pursuant to a rule codified as Env-Wm 315 effective July 1, 1991 and amended December 24, 1991.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100) #8460-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #14103, effective 10-23-24 (formerly Env-Sw 104.50) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
